OL,3,GNEWSADismay as charges introduced at
OL,4,ABrighton car park
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents and businesses have expressed
OL,7,Fdismay after charges were introduced at
OL,8,Fa busy Brighton car park which was
OL,9,Fpreviously free.
OL,11,FThe six-storey Brighton Marina Car
OL,12,FPark, which sits on the eastern edge of
OL,13,Fthe city's seafront, now costs #1 an
OL,14,Fhour to use across 24 hours a day.
OL,16,FAnna MacDonald, a visitor to the
OL,17,Fmarina, told BBC Radio Sussex she was
OL,18,F"quite shocked" by the change, and that
OL,19,Fshe would "go somewhere else that's
OL,20,Ffree instead".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
