OL,3,GNEWSADismay as charges introduced at
OL,4,ABrighton car park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Brighton Marina spokesperson said the
OL,7,Fnew system would allow "continued
OL,8,Finvestment in the car park, helping to
OL,9,Ffund essential repairs, maintenance,
OL,10,Fand facility improvements".
